  p50=123.412µs   p95=311.272µs   p99=311.272µs   max=311.272µs   mean=152.425µs 

Notes:
  - Build with GOEXPERIMENT=numa to enable mbind(MPOL_PREFERRED) on arenas.
  - Ensure kernel.numa_balancing=1 (check: cat /proc/sys/kernel/numa_balancing).
  - Run on a machine with 2+ NUMA nodes for meaningful results.
  - Larger -heap and longer -warm show more pronounced differences.
